00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:41.890
des notes manuscrites

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:42.790
par rapport au CRM.

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.470
Les registres d'inventaire

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:46.450
s'ajustent en temps réel

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:47.630
